{"study_accession":"PRJNA396759","secondary_study_accession":"SRP114539","title":"KSHV vIRF3 promotes angiogenesis of lymphatic endothelial cells (LECs)","description":"Herein, we report viral interferon regulatory factor 3 (vIRF3) as a pro-angiogenic factor together with HDAC5 that coordinates with LEC transcriptome, thus resulting in hyper-sprouting formation and ultimately leading to abnormal lymphangiogenesis. Overexpression of vIRF3 in LECs but not blood endothelial cells (BECs) exhibited a unique KSHV-associated angiogenic effect, evidenced by elongated spindle shape, sprouting, and tube formation. Furthermore, using vIRF3 knockout recombinant KSHV, we confirmed that vIRF3 is a critical factor of KSHV-mediated lymphangiogenesis in primary LECs. Overall design: 3 control, 3 overexpressor each in LECs and BECs.","pubmed":"29339432","geo_series":"","n_samples":6,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN07977178","study_accession":"PRJNA396759","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"BEC vIRF3 replicate 3","description":"BEC vIRF3 replicate 3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2839980","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2017-12-20","attributes":[["source_name","blood endothelial cells"],["cell_type","blood endothelial cells (BEC)"],["genotype","V5/vIRF3 overexpression"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR6255528","experiment_accession":"SRX3362019","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":44690017,"base_count":3375240430,"first_public":"2017-12-20","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM2839980: BEC vIRF3 replicate 3 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN07977179","study_accession":"PRJNA396759","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"BEC vIRF3 replicate 2","description":"BEC vIRF3 replicate 2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM2839979","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2017-12-20","attri